WEBVTT

00:00:03.880 --> 00:00:05.590
Happy New Year!

00:00:06.320 --> 00:00:07.590
Happy New Year.

00:00:11.510 --> 00:00:13.190
It's very crowded.

00:00:13.190 --> 00:00:16.600
It's actually my first time doing this.

00:00:16.600 --> 00:00:20.060
It's so crowded and noisy, and I'm cold...

00:00:20.060 --> 00:00:22.610
I could buy warm sweet sake
from one of the stalls.

00:00:22.610 --> 00:00:26.610
Would you be able to?
There are too many people, Anna.

00:00:26.610 --> 00:00:30.570
<i>Oh, but with a crowd like this,
I doubt we'll bump into the guys!</i>

00:00:30.570 --> 00:00:32.130
Yay!

00:00:33.820 --> 00:00:36.140
Mari-san! Anna-san!

00:00:36.910 --> 00:00:38.220
Happy New Year!

00:00:38.220 --> 00:00:40.750
Awesome. We've managed to meet up.

00:00:42.290 --> 00:00:45.740
How did you even find us in this huge crowd?!

00:00:46.660 --> 00:00:49.210
You're very recognizable from behind.

00:00:49.210 --> 00:00:50.480
Huh?! Eww! You're so creepy!

00:00:50.480 --> 00:00:52.590
Happy New Year.
Huh?! Eww! You're so creepy!

00:00:52.590 --> 00:00:53.220
And many more.

00:00:53.600 --> 00:00:56.210
As usual, it's really crowded...

00:00:56.210 --> 00:00:58.230
We're barely even moving.

00:01:00.400 --> 00:01:03.940
What about Hashiba-kun, Naoe-kun, and Yukirin?

00:01:04.490 --> 00:01:07.050
Tsuyopon and Yukirin are in Tokyo for an event.

00:01:07.050 --> 00:01:09.800
And Na-chan's just got over
a cold, so he decided to pass.

00:01:10.780 --> 00:01:12.410
I see.

00:01:14.710 --> 00:01:15.340
Disappointed?

00:01:15.340 --> 00:01:17.100
Uh, well...

00:01:17.100 --> 00:01:19.750
I was thinking I should apologize.

00:01:20.750 --> 00:01:23.570
Again, thank you for your help, Katakura-kun.

00:01:24.600 --> 00:01:26.090
Nah, it was nothing.

00:01:26.090 --> 00:01:28.590
Ugh, I've had enough! I'm leaving!

00:01:28.970 --> 00:01:30.010
Give up!

00:01:30.010 --> 00:01:32.320
Cut it out, Onii-chan.

00:01:32.730 --> 00:01:34.680
<i>If Hashiba-kun isn't coming...</i>

00:01:35.520 --> 00:01:37.640
<i>...I won't be able to ask him about that.</i>

00:01:38.700 --> 00:01:41.020
<i>Would texting about it be okay?</i>

00:01:41.020 --> 00:01:42.330
<i>Probably not.</i>

00:01:43.150 --> 00:01:45.980
<i>If he can't make it, he can't make it.</i>

00:01:45.980 --> 00:01:48.280
<i>And it's not like we had plans to meet...</i>

00:01:49.940 --> 00:01:52.070
<i>Oh, I know!</i>

00:03:23.800 --> 00:03:24.880
<i>I'm bored.</i>

00:03:24.880 --> 00:03:27.850
<i>I'm here at Hokkaido Shrine,
where a large crowd has gathered.</i>

00:03:28.670 --> 00:03:30.960
<i>The temperature out here is -2”C.</i>

00:03:32.160 --> 00:03:35.260
<i>I wonder if everyone's out for Hatsumoude...</i>

00:03:35.260 --> 00:03:37.450
<i>Wish I could've gone.</i>

00:03:37.450 --> 00:03:41.080
<i>I'm feeling better than expected.
I bet I could've gone out.</i>

00:03:41.080 --> 00:03:43.260
<i>And I'm on my second bowl of soba...</i>

00:03:51.680 --> 00:03:54.480
<i>Tsuyopon and Yukirin are so
lovey-dovey, I'm jealous.</i>

00:03:55.260 --> 00:03:59.160
<i>Will the day ever come when I can
be like that with Kobayakawa-san, too?</i>

00:04:01.010 --> 00:04:02.490
<i>Kobayakawa-san?</i>

00:04:04.090 --> 00:04:05.790
Hello?

00:04:06.420 --> 00:04:08.700
Happy New Year, Hashiba-kun.

00:04:08.700 --> 00:04:10.620
Happy New Year!

00:04:10.620 --> 00:04:13.540
Sorry to call so suddenly.

00:04:13.900 --> 00:04:15.470
How's your cold?

00:04:15.470 --> 00:04:16.460
Mhm, I feel better!

00:04:18.380 --> 00:04:20.910
<i>I said in my text that I was fine.</i>

00:04:20.910 --> 00:04:24.410
<i>But she was still worried
enough to call. I'm so happy!</i>

00:04:24.410 --> 00:04:25.510
Actually...

00:04:25.510 --> 00:04:28.470
We met up with Matsunaga-kun and the others.

00:04:28.470 --> 00:04:29.040
Huh?

00:04:29.040 --> 00:04:30.620
We're at Hokkaido Shrine.

00:04:31.730 --> 00:04:33.360
<i>I had no idea!</i>

00:04:33.360 --> 00:04:34.660
<i>It's not fair!</i>

00:04:34.660 --> 00:04:35.400
And so...

00:04:36.060 --> 00:04:37.920
I bought a charm.

00:04:37.920 --> 00:04:39.070
For good health.

00:04:39.460 --> 00:04:41.460
Do you mean... for me?

00:04:41.460 --> 00:04:41.910
Yeah.

00:04:41.910 --> 00:04:45.400
I was hoping I could
give it to you sometime soon.

00:04:46.280 --> 00:04:47.540
What day is good for you?

00:04:47.540 --> 00:04:48.830
Uh, um...

00:04:49.270 --> 00:04:50.700
Any day is good for me!

00:04:50.700 --> 00:04:52.210
Tomorrow, the day after,

00:04:52.210 --> 00:04:54.000
even today if you prefer!

00:04:54.000 --> 00:04:55.940
Oh, but now's a little late for today...

00:04:57.650 --> 00:05:00.210
Aren't you feeling ill?

00:05:00.210 --> 00:05:02.180
No, I'm a bundle of energy right now.

00:05:04.110 --> 00:05:05.100
Then...

00:05:05.100 --> 00:05:08.050
I could come by your place in a bit.

00:05:09.520 --> 00:05:10.790
Sure!

00:05:10.790 --> 00:05:12.350
But here wouldn't be so good...

00:05:12.350 --> 00:05:13.410
Uh...

00:05:13.410 --> 00:05:15.460
Your train stops at Naka-doori Station, right?

00:05:15.460 --> 00:05:16.390
Let's meet there.

00:05:16.390 --> 00:05:18.860
Sure. In about 40 minutes, then.

00:05:26.270 --> 00:05:27.590
No time to waste!

00:05:27.590 --> 00:05:28.950
I've gotta get ready to go!

00:05:29.310 --> 00:05:31.340
<i>Ah! Can't forget this!</i>

00:05:31.340 --> 00:05:34.030
<i>Good. I can finally give her the present.</i>

00:05:34.030 --> 00:05:36.460
<i>And apologize properly, in person!</i>

00:05:36.950 --> 00:05:38.510
<i>But still...</i>

00:05:38.510 --> 00:05:42.510
<i>Going to the trouble of getting me a charm?
That's so kind of her!</i>

00:05:43.010 --> 00:05:45.690
<i>Thank you, Kobayakawa-san!</i>

00:05:45.690 --> 00:05:48.410
<i>Naka-doori, Naka-doori.</i>

00:05:48.410 --> 00:05:48.970
Um...

00:05:49.250 --> 00:05:51.250
I'm getting off here.

00:05:51.250 --> 00:05:54.390
Huh? Your house isn't around here.

00:05:54.390 --> 00:05:56.490
I need to stop by a place.

00:05:56.490 --> 00:05:58.520
You do?

00:05:58.520 --> 00:06:00.190
Okay, take care.

00:06:00.510 --> 00:06:03.310
Sure. See you later. Goodbye, everyone.

00:06:06.990 --> 00:06:10.120
Where'd she be stopping by
at this time of night?

00:06:10.120 --> 00:06:11.040
Who knows?

00:06:14.350 --> 00:06:15.500
<i>Let's see...</i>

00:06:15.500 --> 00:06:17.880
<i>Where do I go?</i>

00:06:21.400 --> 00:06:22.350
I've arrived.

00:06:22.350 --> 00:06:24.600
Oh! Kobayakawa-san!

00:06:31.650 --> 00:06:32.740
Oh, good.

00:06:32.740 --> 00:06:34.560
Thanks for meeting me in the station.

00:06:35.220 --> 00:06:37.650
Yeah, it's cold outside.

00:06:37.650 --> 00:06:40.820
Oh. Happy New Year.

00:06:40.820 --> 00:06:42.830
Happy New Year.

00:06:45.330 --> 00:06:46.740
Um...

00:06:47.030 --> 00:06:49.840
Uh, Kobayakawa-san!

00:06:49.840 --> 00:06:50.530
Y-Yes?

00:06:51.080 --> 00:06:54.200
I'm really sorry for causing you trouble on Christmas.

00:06:54.540 --> 00:06:56.410
I'll be more careful in the future.

00:06:56.830 --> 00:06:57.730
And so...

00:06:59.620 --> 00:07:00.750
<i>And so?</i>

00:07:01.390 --> 00:07:02.280
Um...

00:07:04.650 --> 00:07:06.590
<i>And so, what?</i>

00:07:06.990 --> 00:07:09.680
I hope it's a good year for us both.

00:07:14.380 --> 00:07:15.560
I hope so too.

00:07:18.900 --> 00:07:20.800
Shall we sit down?

00:07:20.800 --> 00:07:23.390
I'd like to go somewhere,
but it's New Year's and all,

00:07:23.390 --> 00:07:25.330
and there aren't any restaurants nearby.

00:07:25.330 --> 00:07:26.880
Here is fine.

00:07:30.290 --> 00:07:32.770
I should apologize myself,
for springing this on you suddenly.

00:07:32.770 --> 00:07:33.930
How's your cold?

00:07:33.930 --> 00:07:36.160
It's alright. And I was bored anyway.

00:07:36.930 --> 00:07:38.110
Um...

00:07:38.110 --> 00:07:39.180
Actually...

00:07:40.810 --> 00:07:43.090
There's something I wanted to ask you.

00:07:43.690 --> 00:07:45.490
About that.

00:07:45.490 --> 00:07:46.460
"That"?

00:07:46.920 --> 00:07:47.550
Ah!

00:07:47.550 --> 00:07:49.350
Oh, that!

00:07:49.350 --> 00:07:50.340
I brought it with me.

00:07:50.790 --> 00:07:54.030
Here. The present I wasn't able to give you.

00:07:54.030 --> 00:07:54.940
Huh?

00:07:56.000 --> 00:07:57.270
Thank... you...

00:07:59.230 --> 00:08:01.190
And I brought the charm.

00:08:01.900 --> 00:08:03.020
Here.

00:08:04.410 --> 00:08:06.110
Thank you for being so considerate.

00:08:06.890 --> 00:08:07.910
<i>Huh?</i>

00:08:07.910 --> 00:08:10.410
<i>Something seems off...</i>

00:08:10.710 --> 00:08:12.290
I'll pay you back.

00:08:12.290 --> 00:08:13.270
It's okay.

00:08:13.270 --> 00:08:16.370
Come to think of it, I never paid for my food...

00:08:16.370 --> 00:08:17.400
I should pay you.

00:08:17.400 --> 00:08:19.580
N-No, that's okay.

00:08:19.580 --> 00:08:22.100
I'll just take this.

00:08:22.100 --> 00:08:23.080
Okay.

00:08:24.360 --> 00:08:25.460
<i>I wonder why...</i>

00:08:26.690 --> 00:08:27.670
Yeah!

00:08:28.020 --> 00:08:31.340
With this, I'm sure I won't
catch any more colds this year.

00:08:33.240 --> 00:08:34.260
I hope so.

00:08:34.740 --> 00:08:38.280
The experience taught me to be
more careful about my health.

00:08:38.280 --> 00:08:40.740
True, it was pretty cold that day.

00:08:40.740 --> 00:08:41.640
You said it.

00:08:42.400 --> 00:08:45.770
But I never thought I'd collapse
and fall unconscious!

00:08:46.150 --> 00:08:49.110
It's a good thing I didn't give you my cold.

00:08:49.110 --> 00:08:50.400
<i>Huh?</i>

00:08:50.400 --> 00:08:51.630
Unconscious?

00:08:51.630 --> 00:08:55.200
Oh, true, you didn't respond when
I said your name... Were you okay?

00:08:55.200 --> 00:08:58.580
Yeah, it wasn't that bad, really.

00:08:59.280 --> 00:09:00.590
It's just...

00:09:00.590 --> 00:09:03.370
I don't remember Mattsun
and Kei-chan turning up.

00:09:03.950 --> 00:09:09.240
Actually, everything's pretty hazy
starting around when you gave me the gloves.

00:09:10.590 --> 00:09:13.130
I'm pretty shocked about that, too.

00:09:13.130 --> 00:09:14.010
Then...

00:09:14.590 --> 00:09:17.390
You don't remember what
you did before you collapsed?

00:09:18.950 --> 00:09:19.810
Right.

00:09:21.430 --> 00:09:23.870
Wait, did I say something weird?

00:09:23.870 --> 00:09:25.260
Or make an awful face?

00:09:25.260 --> 00:09:26.940
Or... did I throw up?

00:09:27.730 --> 00:09:28.550
No.

00:09:32.050 --> 00:09:33.010
Nothing like that.

00:09:34.490 --> 00:09:37.700
You just seemed a bit different than usual.

00:09:37.700 --> 00:09:38.950
So I was a bit worried.

00:09:40.240 --> 00:09:42.790
Oh. I see.

00:09:43.390 --> 00:09:45.270
Sorry to worry you.

00:09:45.270 --> 00:09:46.960
I really am all better now.

00:09:46.960 --> 00:09:49.780
<i>The final train departing for Fukuou
is now arriving at the station.</i>

00:09:50.710 --> 00:09:52.180
<i>Passengers for that train,
please come to the platform.</i>

00:09:52.180 --> 00:09:54.960
That's my train. I need to catch it.

00:09:54.960 --> 00:09:56.140
Oh, I'll walk you home!

00:09:56.620 --> 00:09:58.050
No, I'll be fine.

00:09:58.050 --> 00:10:00.920
My father will drive over
to the station to pick me up.

00:10:00.920 --> 00:10:03.070
Oh, that's good to know.

00:10:03.070 --> 00:10:04.690
That's real nice of him.

00:10:05.440 --> 00:10:07.560
Well, I'll text you later.

00:10:08.050 --> 00:10:09.990
Sure. Take care.

00:10:17.050 --> 00:10:19.020
Whew, thank goodness!

00:10:19.020 --> 00:10:23.070
I was worried she'd gotten upset
by all the trouble I caused.

00:10:23.070 --> 00:10:24.410
But she's just like always.

00:10:26.570 --> 00:10:27.540
<i>In the end...</i>

00:10:28.270 --> 00:10:30.960
<i>...l wasn't able to confess last year...</i>

00:10:31.720 --> 00:10:35.250
<i>...but I hope that this year
will bring even better things.</i>

00:10:40.140 --> 00:10:43.070
<i>I'm glad Hashiba-kun is feeling better.</i>

00:10:43.070 --> 00:10:45.020
<i>He's just like always again.</i>

00:10:45.020 --> 00:10:47.650
<i>Just... like always.</i>

00:10:47.650 --> 00:10:49.940
<i>He didn't remember it.</i>

00:10:50.750 --> 00:10:52.930
<i>Maybe I misunderstood it?</i>

00:10:52.930 --> 00:10:57.860
<i>Maybe he was just feeling ill
and stumbled into me?</i>

00:10:58.160 --> 00:10:59.800
<i>No.</i>

00:10:59.800 --> 00:11:01.280
<i>I remember it.</i>

00:11:01.900 --> 00:11:03.530
<i>But it's troubling...</i>

00:11:03.530 --> 00:11:07.210
<i>If he doesn't remember doing it,
he wouldn't know why he did it.</i>

00:11:07.550 --> 00:11:11.690
<i>I had hoped he'd tell me why when we met...</i>

00:11:11.690 --> 00:11:14.010
<i>Maybe there was no reason?</i>

00:11:14.010 --> 00:11:16.440
<i>Maybe I should just forget it happened?</i>

00:11:16.440 --> 00:11:19.180
<i>Should I pretend it never happened?</i>

00:11:19.790 --> 00:11:21.070
<i>What should I do?</i>

00:11:21.070 --> 00:11:22.060
<i>And...</i>

00:11:22.700 --> 00:11:25.480
<i>...why does thinking about it
make me feel so sad?</i>

00:11:26.730 --> 00:11:29.190
<i>I have all these feelings mixed up inside.</i>

00:11:29.190 --> 00:11:31.020
<i>I just don't know...</i>
